{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47165","headline":"题栖霞寺僧房 · 处默","name":"题栖霞寺僧房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名山不取买山钱，任构花宫近碧巅。\n松桧老依云里寺，楼台深锁洞中天。\n风经绝嶂回疎雨，石倚危屏挂落泉。\n欲结茅庵共师住，肯饶多少薜萝烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"处默","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}